'''Move Jerry''' is a {{Common}} item.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Move Jerry''' can be claimed from [[Jerry]] after clicking [[Jerry#Purpose|Move Jerry]] in their [[Jerry#Interface|interface]]. If the player already has a '''Move Jerry''' in their inventory, [[Jerry]] will not give the player another one. This can be bypassed by storing the '''Move Jerry''' in a different inventory and claiming another one.

== Usage ==
=== Moving Jerry ===
A '''Move Jerry''' can be used to change [[Jerry]]'s location on the player's [[Private Island]]. The new spawn location has to be on top of a solid block, and cannot be placed above the void.

