=== Mutations ===
In order to obtain a {{Item|Jerryflower}}, the {{Item|Fertilized Jerryseed}} needs to be  given {{Item|Move Jerry|amount=10}} to continue growing past {{Dark Green|Growth Stage}} {{Green|5}}.

